### 1.2 Route map today

| Route | File | Nature |
|---|---|---|
| `/` | `app/page.tsx` | **async server component**, `export const dynamic = "force-dynamic"`; reads session; currently a placeholder ("Your Pulse is being prepared.") |
| `/preview` | `app/preview/page.tsx` | **static server component** (no `dynamic` export, no `cookies()`); wraps a client island |
| `/onboarding`, `/signin`, `/signup`, `/reset-password` | `app/*/page.tsx` | client islands / server shells |

**Important:** the design spec says `/` *is* the Pulse Digest (`EXPERIENCE.md` IA table row 1), but the code currently renders the placeholder. There is no digest route/component yet.

