## 3. Styling approach

### 3.1 It is Tailwind CSS v4 — but **there is no `styles/tokens.ts`**

The token API is **`frontend/styles/tokens.css`** (a Tailwind v4 `@theme static` block), consumed via **Tailwind utility classes**, with arbitrary-value syntax `[font:var(--type-scale-meta-sm)]` and `[max-w-(--layout-container-max)]` for non-namespace vars.

There is **no CSS Modules, no CSS-in-JS, no styled-components**. Everything is inline `className` strings in TSX. `frontend/postcss.config.mjs` wires `@tailwindcss/postcss`.

### 3.2 `styles/tokens.css` — the token API

Header comment (verbatim):

```css
/*
 * Design tokens: DESIGN.md (ux-EventPulse24-2026-08-23) §Token Implementation Contract.
 *
 * - Names are the kebab-case form of each token path (color.accent.terracotta ->
 *   --color-accent-terracotta). Path aliases are not declared: color.ink.meta reads
 *   --color-ink-muted, color.cool.public reads --color-accent-slate.
 * - Light values are the :root default (emitted by @theme static); dark overrides live under
 *   [data-theme="dark"], which <html> carries by default. The theme never follows the OS setting.
 * - Tailwind's own palette, radii, shadows, animations, easings, fonts, spacing multiplier and
 *   breakpoints are reset, so only these tokens exist as utilities (bg-surface-paper,
 *   rounded-card, p-4, shadow-floating, font-display, md:, lg:).
 * - styles/tokens.test.ts checks every color against DESIGN.md itself.
 */
```

**Namespace resets** — Tailwind's stock scales are wiped, so only DESIGN.md tokens exist:

```css
@theme static {
  --color-*: initial;
  --radius-*: initial;
  --shadow-*: initial;
  --animate-*: initial;
  --ease-*: initial;
  --font-*: initial;
  --spacing: initial;
  --breakpoint-*: initial;

  --breakpoint-md: 768px;
  --breakpoint-lg: 1024px;
```

**Colors** (light default; dark overrides under `[data-theme="dark"]`):

```css
  --color-surface-paper: #faf8f4;
  --color-surface-elevated: #ffffff;
  --color-surface-subtle: #f1ece3;
  --color-surface-inset: #ede7da;
  --color-ink-primary: #1a1814;
  --color-ink-secondary: #3a352d;
  --color-ink-muted: #7a7066;
  --color-ink-faint: #c9c2b5;
  --color-ink-inverse: #faf8f4;
  --color-surface-paper-darker: #f4f0e8;
  --color-warm-personal: #a8765c;
  --color-warn-amber: #b8893d;
  --color-accent-terracotta: #c4502b;
  --color-accent-slate: #5b6b7e;
  --color-accent-amber: #c77a2c;
  --color-signal-success: #4a7a4a;
  --color-signal-warn: #b8893a;
  --color-signal-error: #8e2a1f;
  --color-border-subtle: rgba(26, 24, 20, 0.08);
